i": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12331069_1692938717459161_6286521335979966464_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TcdH8q73LygQ7kNvwF5y2cM&_nc_oc=AdlNwSitJEebmwCmWyvk8QnrOBnFVen9pEyCtnfdG8ZH0efxKkXP9CuQXkWjEhanIhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv3xi5i0D80WomvBfrWKc_q8bwxMcrh8mPpzg0LQQwEEw&oe=699DB691"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Video Thumbnail.png", "id": "173833590106093", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410407_173833593439426_6561057990592430080_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=CFyNIW39KVMQ7kNvwFOK8WR&_nc_oc=AdlxxztWE5wTgcW1-DipxGBMh8A9jVQluE__7Bje9Ds3jkk_2XrhyKZS2B7hmhqv5w0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsoTeQ5cbwJTi9yzE5lE4hIGgUSFaGqS9y4QVOzm9iHXg&oe=699D8DCB"}, "display_name": "YouTube VR", "keywords": ["Video", "Movies", "Shows", "TV", "Live"], "long_description": "Experience your favorite YouTube channels, videos and creators in virtual reality.\n\nThe YouTube VR app turns every video on the platform into your own virtual reality experience and reimagines YouTube as a 3D world you can explore from the inside. \n\nExperience YouTube like never before\n\u2022 Explore every video on YouTube, from 3D 360 videos to standard rectangular videos\n\u2022 Get the full, signed-in experience that lets you view subscriptions, playlists, watch history and more\n\u2022 Choose to co-watch videos with others, talk about them live, and enjoy a shared experience all in the same virtual room\n\nSee and hear it all\n\u2022 Immerse yourself in full 360-degree videos that put you at the center of the action\n\u2022 Experience spatial audio, where depth and distance play a role depending on where you look\n\u2022 Switch between voice and keyboard controls to browse and search with ease\n\n\nPermission Notice\n\u2022 Microphone: Needed to allow searching for YouTube content with your voice and social communication", 